@startuml AgentPay Human Purchase Sequence
!theme plain
title AgentPay — Human Purchase Through Shared Commerce

actor Buyer
participant "Hosted storefront" as Web
participant "AgentPay API" as API
participant "Human checkout provider" as Checkout
participant "Transaction service" as Transactions
participant "Seller API" as Seller
participant "Evidence service" as Evidence

Buyer -> Web : Select published product
Web -> API : Create immutable purchase intent\nchannel=human
API --> Web : Frozen seller quote and approval requirement
Web -> Checkout : Start hosted checkout
Buyer -> Checkout : Complete payment
Checkout -> API : Authenticated idempotent callback
API -> Transactions : Verify payment and claim fulfillment once
Transactions -> Evidence : Append payment verification
Transactions -> Seller : Forward signed request
Seller --> Transactions : Return digital result
Transactions -> Evidence : Append delivery outcome
API --> Web : Return fulfillment and transaction status
@enduml
